  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Primary path",
      "items": [
        "Browser → Nginx TLS → Next.js standalone (PM2, 127.0.0.1:3100) → route() on every /api/v1 call",
        "route(): tenant from Host, cookie JWT, one live session, device trust, x-roles, If-Match, Idempotency-Key",
        "Handler runs in one transaction with set_config(app.tenant_id/user_id/role); stage changes only via transition(), which commits audit + outbox rows with the change"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust boundaries",
      "items": [
        "People use cookies (Supabase JWT); the CRM signs raw bodies with HMAC-SHA256 (300 s skew) and may never call /auth routes",
        "Nginx is the only public listener; the server holds only the ecofy_app role and RLS enforces tenant and role per transaction",
        "Money lives only in *_values tables readable by the role on the row; Ecofy and the CRM never read each other database (CONFLICTS #24)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Worker and external services",
      "items": [
        "Outbox relay every 2 s (SKIP LOCKED, in order, at-least-once); CRM deliveries every 5 s with back-off, 12 attempts then DEAD",
        "Croner jobs in IST under a system context (ITARANG_ADMIN, actor NULL); inbound CRM events run the normal module services as the integration user",
        "Adapters by env: storage local|s3, mail dev|ses, sms dev|gupshup, queue inline|bullmq (Redis); staging runs the dev drivers, which write to .data/"
      ]
    }
  ]
